Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.13,0:00:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The terrorists who targeted the train for Garm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,merged to create an automa through\Nthe power of the primary red gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Consequently, the train went out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I connected myself to the massive amount of ether\Nin Akari to conjure a major spell and avert disaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but my heart is still anxious over a\Nbizarre sensation I felt during the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. So you felt it too, Momo? That bizarre sensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did. I see what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think that was the moment when Boobalicious\Nused her Pure Concept to turn back time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari has the Pure Concept of Time. It makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were about to crash into the train up ahead,\Nwhich would have been a huge disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:01:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I have a hunch... that it actually happened once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And Boobalicious turned back time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then you mean she can turn back\Ntime for the entire world as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She can turn back just her own time,\Nor for the entire world at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time for some reason,\Nshe chose to turn the whole world back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.38,0:01:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe she unconsciously wanted to\Nsave the other passengers as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her? You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how ordinary girls think.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about the non-ordinary girl\Nyou got tangled up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean that crappy little princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I actually thought about squishing her dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I did the civil thing and shook her off my tail instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should be proud of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a good girl. You did a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well then, Momo. I'll see you in Garm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've said this before,\Nbut please do be careful of Miss Boobalicious there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:02:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are two days until the ritual for elimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure she doesn't use her\NPure Concept any more than she already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Later, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said, that's not what I'm worried about...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A Pure Concept that is improperly\Nattached is perpetually unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It grows the more it's used,\Nmaking it even more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To make sure a tragic Human Error never happens again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To never let there be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.83,0:02:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Another one like me from that incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I remembered was my name, "Menou."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I felt no sorrow, no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was simply there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've always had a flair for flashy maneuvers...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Orwell you old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit yourself, Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You do love acting in secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My role is different from yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it. I'm going to look around for survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll leave that girl in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't this kind of thing your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.67,0:04:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You recently became a Master, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should take on an unfamiliar task once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a priestess: pure, just, and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So the etheric connect doesn't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As magecraft material, you're top quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So? What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you have a request I'll at least hear you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:34.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've been blanched\Nboth physically and mentally, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm going back that way,\NI'll take care of you until the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:59.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you don't die before then,\Nyou can do what you want after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thus, I ended up traveling for a while with that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And at some point,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I learned that the woman was\Nwhat was called an Executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel anything about that in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eventually, we arrived at a great continent of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They say this used to be one big continent\Nthat was home to multitudes of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now everything has turned to salt,\Nand it's gradually dissolving into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:50.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it won't be too far off\Nwhen it dissolves completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the Sword of Salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Purification embodied that turns all it pierces to salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:07:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A sword that can destroy the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The whole world could have\Nmet the fate of this continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:08.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is what a Pure Concept can do,\Nand the Human Error it can bring about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of calamity otherworlders can cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.79,0:07:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact that your town was\Nwiped out is relatively benign.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sensed in that moment that this person had made\Nthe long journey to bring me here just to tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just so she could give those words to a\Ngirl who had lost all sense of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This person...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who had looked blackish red and frightening at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've decided what I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want to end up like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:57.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm an Executioner. A villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:08:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you were a priestess\Nwho is pure, just, and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you so stupid that you don't know what sarcasm is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You stand up to the kind of thing\Nthat happened to my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate what it became, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you say you're a villain, then I'll be one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why not become an ordinary priestess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You might very well become one\Nthat's pure, just, and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're choosing the wrong path.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can still change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I ask what your name is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can call me "Master."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.33,0:08:57.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She took me to a convent in the depths of the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, I learned many things:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About magecraft, about the nation called Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the taboo entities that came from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They say our ancient civilization\Nonce dominated the continents,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,conquered the seas,\Nand even went beyond the skies to visit the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That prosperity was made possible by making\Nrampant use of the otherworlders' Pure Concepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can see the extent of our dependency by how their\Nlanguage became the universal language of our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That civilization perished due to four Human Errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:38.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was the result of Pure Concepts evolving out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Otherworlders have no means of returning to their world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, the only way to deal with\Notherworlders who come to this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We also learned how to kill the taboo entities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why do we kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:09:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because we are the villains, that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think it's for justice? For our faith? For the Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:09:59.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Next!\N{\rSubtitle}You think it's for justice? For our faith? For the Lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think it's for justice? For our faith? For the Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No! There is no such vindication!\NWe don't get to be righteous!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We are resented, hated, and will\Neventually get tossed aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of villains we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill any and all otherworlders,\Nregardless of whether they are good or bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Speak of friendship. Whisper words of love.\NBe dirty and underhanded to kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:24.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until the day comes when you die...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:27.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And keep on killing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stab them? Kill them? What's wrong with everyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate people who would tolerate the idea of murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a new girl who's two years younger\Nthan me who I see crying a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think she wants to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not just her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,None of the girls here want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:02.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:09.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So Master, make me the only bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:16.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll kill more otherworlders than anyone else,\Nto make up for that girl and all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make up for the others? You? Kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, you may have value as magecraft material,\Nbut your etheric capacity is below average.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:33.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your physical capabilities are even lower,\Nalthough better than the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your mental abilities like memory, mental acuity,\Nand resourcefulness are so-so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just around average.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:43.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your face isn't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have the potential to deceive with your charms,\Nbe it man or woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A step up from average.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Overall, a tad below average.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:58.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you really determined to be\Nlike me with that kind of talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't make me like you. I want to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A villain who has culled the most taboos\Nin history and is pure, just, and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An awfully twisted personality has\Nemerged from your blanched out soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I will beat everything I know into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I mean everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Assimilate everything I am into the blank soul of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and when one day all of it is destroyed by\Nhappiness and you still manage to survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's when you'll surpass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:57.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To begin, let's do something about\Nyour wretched etheric control
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,by teaching you how to use etheric camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But before that, you should do something with your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of cases where you\Ncan manipulate people with your looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's called having a sense of style.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. "Style," got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, you'd better keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From that day forth,\NI went through a long, long period of training
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.33,0:13:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to become Master Flare's successor:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the promise I made with Master Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to kill more otherworlders than anyone,\Nas many as I possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was a nice nap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's afternoon already, sleepyhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:52.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look! We can see it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that Garm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's where the ceremonial hall is\Nwhere we can send you back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a pretty city!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it? Garm is famous for its scenic beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, Menou! I want to go see the sights here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, together with you, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think fun things are even better with two people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure. But first, there's a place I need to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a date, okay? You'd better keep your promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There?! Is that castle where we're going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the former royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's Noblesse territory where the royalty,\Nnobility and knights are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have business over that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the cathedral, a sacred place for us Faust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say the Faust and\Nthe Noblesse don't get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But they're next to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:07.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a historic city, so I'm sure there are reasons for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:11.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's where we'll find the\Nhall we're looking for, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.71,0:15:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oooh. Woow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sooo pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop talking. You sound like an idiot, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You make some pretty biting\Ncomments sometimes, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Only because you keep acting like a dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, you're so cold! I'm going home soon, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it really is something, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never actually been in this cathedral before,\Nbut it's breathtaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Resplendent, elaborate, and it's even\Nadorned with multiple magecraft crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that so amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It enhances the outer wall as a protective barrier,\Nbut also has a barrier that functions internally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a highly efficient setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.75,0:15:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.71,0:15:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Only a select few have the skill to activate it effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like Archbishop Orwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:16:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you for your kind words, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Archbishop Orwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for not noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No need to be so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we finally get to meet, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard there was trouble on the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm sorry for the worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then you must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-my name is Akari Tokitou!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, I'm Orwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've heard about your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How awful it must have been to be\Nsuddenly summoned to another world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it honestly wasn't anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Rest assured...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The preparations for the ritual that will\Nsend you home are coming along just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should be able to hold it two days from now, at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-ah! I do appreciate it so deeply much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari! Your words are coming out all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, what do you intend to do\Nonce the ritual is over, Miss Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.08,0:16:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're planning to take the\NPilgrimage Route along the border,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the Church can cover your pilgrimage expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.17,0:16:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, really?! Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, if you would like to be helpful in return,\NI'd like to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the incidents happening\Nin Garm I told you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I believe you said that a series of\Nyoung women have gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you could look\Ninto it until the ritual is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll be of any help?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need a different perspective on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you don't end up finding anything, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right. If you say so, Archbishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'm counting on you, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a nice room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:42.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Archbishop must have pulled some strings for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:54.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you mad about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.63,0:17:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We promised it would be a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You said we would go sight-seeing together,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but then you went and promised that\Narchbishop lady something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean the investigation? But that-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In return, you're getting money for\Nsome pilgrimage thingy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course that's more important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen, Akari-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To you, that lady's an important\Nperson you respect, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But me, I'm just some stranger passing\Nby who's going to be gone soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it like that-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The day after tomorrow, Akari will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.71,0:18:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez! Stupid Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:00.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the stupid one...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou? Did you want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a series of disappearances, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think human trafficking is\Nrampant in this city or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently not. They've investigated that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then maybe some heretic is collecting\Nmaterial to summon a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It does feel like an Original Sin\Nmight be involved somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to look into that side of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Well, I don't mind helping out, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,While I'm investigating this, what will you be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh?! Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari and I are uh... going sight-seeing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But of course you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't bring that useless set of boobs\Nalong with you to do any kind of investigation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uhhh, that's right. I'm glad you understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.13,0:19:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.17,0:20:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love you so much that I'll do anything you ask me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll get this done in no time, just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The primary red gems that those\Nterrorists were told to swallow...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were probably provided by\Nsomeone with magecraft expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The terrorists hinted that they could get\Naway as long as they got to Garm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:29.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If whoever conspired with them is in Garm,\Nmaybe that's where the red gems came from as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that person might be one of\Nthe Noblesse here in the city...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're quick on the uptake.\NExactly. So be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right. I've got it, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I always force the messy stuff on her plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.75,0:20:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know your work as a priestess is really important to you,\Nand I was insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:11.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm sorry. I'll go sight-seeing by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good luck with the job you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Fun things are even better with two people," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you'd rather go alone, that's fine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.79,0:21:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not! I want to go with you, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.67,0:21:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear. I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get it so you can let go of me, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, Akari. Your towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flarette...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:21:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That girl has the potential now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.83,0:22:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Flare?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.79,0:22:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, my lower back hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.46,0:23:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:06.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,316.8)}{\an7}Activate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:06.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,367.2)}{\an7}[Primary Red,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.13,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,374.4)}{\an7}Armored Knight]
